                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "be5ec63f-4b60-3d4a-ae6a-b2c39a69203d",
                        "entry_id": "9c8dcaac-9267-3570-85f2-6fc0b74d3df5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "feminine of чуда́к (čudák); weirdo, oddball"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "colloquial",
                            "feminine",
                            "form-of"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "48f63c6e-1c98-4e26-a9e9-dab0dd74da16",
                                "sense_id": "be5ec63f-4b60-3d4a-ae6a-b2c39a69203d",
                                "text": "«А во всём Петербу́рге никто́ ко мне так не привя́зан, как э́та… чуда́чка! — поду́малось Нежда́нову. — Но ну́жно ж ей бы́ло мне помеша́ть… Впро́чем, всё к лу́чшему!»",
                                "translation": "'And in all Petersburg there is no one cares for me like that . . . queer creature!' was Nezhdanov's thought. 'But why need she have interrupted me? . . . It's all for the best, though!",
                                "english": "'And in all Petersburg there is no one cares for me like that . . . queer creature!' was Nezhdanov's thought. 'But why need she have interrupted me? . . . It's all for the best, though!"
                            }
                        ]
